{"id":"3c13cbc371598986","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-uniform.md","title":"Uniform Operation","display":"df-uniform — Uniform Operation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-uniform","aliases":["93-df-uniform"],"display":"df-uniform — Uniform Operation","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-deterministic]]","[[93-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-uniform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-uniform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform — Uniform Operation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar v_n\">\\(\\bar v_n\\)</span> is the canonical injective variable tuple of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V\\)</span> is an explicit operation family, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Uniform}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Uniform}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n)\">\\(\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n)\\)</span> 的输入满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in V\">\\(\\bar a\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a:n\\to V\">\\(\\bar a:n\\to V\\)</span>；该有限元组构造不依赖未出现在接口中的代数参数，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar v_n(i),\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar v_n(i),\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\n\\to\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n):\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n)\\to|\\mathbf A|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\n\\to\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n):\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n)\\to|\\mathbf A|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform}\\vdash\\mathrm{Uniform}_{93}(\\mathbf f,\\mathcal K,n;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf f(\\mathbf A):|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists t\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n))\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\bigl(\\mathbf f(\\mathbf A)(\\bar a)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n)}(t))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform}\\vdash\\mathrm{Uniform}_{93}(\\mathbf f,\\mathcal K,n;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf f(\\mathbf A):|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists t\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n))\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\bigl(\\mathbf f(\\mathbf A)(\\bar a)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\operatorname{TupleAssign}_{93}(\\bar a;n)}(t))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Arity, common signature, operation totality, and the assignment graph induced by an input tuple are explicit. The family itself is a function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span>, rather than a metalinguistic indexed tuple, and one syntactic term is evaluated uniformly in every member.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deterministic","status":"resolved","id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-deterministic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-5","targe